CE FND-119 gate: GM NRPT=2, the case no previous fixture could reach.
CE Three collinear-in-z copies of one wire, tags 1 / 11 / 21, generated by a
CE single GM card. NRPT=2 means TWO new structures; the transform is cumulative,
CE so copy k sits at k times the translation and carries tag + k*ITGI.
CE nec2c (captured 2026-08-30): 9 segments, tags 1/11/21, z-centres
