CE fnec before the fix: 6 segments, tags 1/11 -- it read field 2 as a LAST TAG
CE and had no repeat loop, so it made at most one copy.
CE The older GM fixtures cannot discriminate this: both use NRPT=1, where the
CE last-tag reading and the NRPT reading happen to agree.
